</span></span> is needed in the kitchen.</li><li>Peter will bring some dining room and living room furniture.</li><li>Jim will buy a <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">6</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-practice-source-2-t4-l-q6\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span> at the store.</li></ul><p>Location of the telephone: in the <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">7</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-practice-source-2-t4-l-q7\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span></p><p>Move-in date: <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">8</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-practice-source-2-t4-l-q8\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span></p><p>Watching the game together: on <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">9</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-practice-source-2-t4-l-q9\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span></p><p>What Jim needs to do before move-in: take <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">10</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-practice-source-2-t4-l-q10\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span> in the morning</p></div><div class=\"source-questions\"><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div></div>","sourceQuestionCount":10}],"audio_fallbacks":["https://engnovate.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/recent_actual_test_2_academic_listening_test_4_1.mp3"],"order_index":1},{"id":"en-practice-source-2-t4-l-p2","title":"Part 2","part_number":2,"passage_text":"","audio_url":"https://ielts-listenin