m\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">29</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-practice-source-2-t4-l-q29\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span></p><p>Final Phase: Group <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">30</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-practice-source-2-t4-l-q30\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span></p></div><div class=\"source-questions\"><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div></div>","sourceQuestionCount":10}],"audio_fallbacks":["https://engnovate.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/recent_actual_test_2_academic_listening_test_4_3.mp3"],"order_index":3},{"id":"en-practice-source-2-t4-l-p4","title":"Part 4","part_number":4,"passage_text":"","audio_url":"https://ielts-listening-audio.engnovatemedia.com/3126752-recent_actual_test_2_academic_listening_test_4_4.mp3","question_groups":[{"id":"en-practice-source-2-t4-l-g4-0","type":"source_html","ieltsQuestionType":"diagram_labelling","instructions":"","sourceHeading":"Questions 31-40","sourceHtml":"<div class=\"source-question-section-content\"><div class=\"source-section-content-wrapper\"><p>Complete the notes below.</p><p>Write ONE WORD ONLY for each answer.</p><p class=\"source-transcript-subhead\"><strong>The Gherkin Building</strong></p><p>Commissioned by: <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">31</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-practice-source-2-t4-l-q31\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span> firm called Foster and Partners</p><p>The features of its appearance:</p><ul><li>Its shape is like a <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">32</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-practice-source-2-t4-l-q32\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span>.</li><li>It can reduce the carbon <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">33</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-practice-source-2-t4-l-q33\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span> of the city.</li><li>It lets <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">34</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-practice-source-2-t4-l-q34\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span> pass through the building, both reducing heating costs and brightening up the workspace</li><li>One false story claimed that the exterior of the building is partly made of <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">35</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-practice-source-2-t4-l-q35\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span>.</li></ul><p>Architectural concept:</p><ul><li>links <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">36</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-practice-source-2-t4-l-q36\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span> with the workplace.</li><li>relies less on <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">37</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-practice-source-2-t4-l-q37\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span> for temperature control than other similar buildings.</li></ul><p>The features of its interior:</p><ul><li>The atria that let fresh air pass through the interior are known as <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">38</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-practice-source-2-t4-l-q38\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span>.</li><li>There is a place for entertainment called the <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">39</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-practice-source-2-t4-l-q39\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span> at the top of the building.</li></ul><p>The future of urban planning and architecture:</p><ul><li>It is likely that the entire <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">40</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-practice-source-2-t4-l-q40\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span> will be designed with more similarly eco-friendly buildings in future.</li><li>A new building will be constructed aiming to produce zero waste and remove carbon dioxide from us as much as possible.</li></ul></div></div><div class=\"source-questions\"><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div></div>","sourceQuestionCount":10}],"audio_fallbacks":["https://engnovate.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/recent_actual_test_2_academic_listening_test_4_4.mp3"],"order_index":4}],"questions":[{"id":"en-practice-source-2-t4-l-q1","part_id":"en-practice-source-2-t4-l-p1","group_id":"en-practice-source-2-t4-l-g1-0","question_type":"source_text","ieltsQuestionType":"diagram_labelling","question_text":"","correct_answer":"80/eighty","correct_answer_variants":["80","eighty"],"answerCount":1,"sourceNumbers":[1],"sourceInputName":"ielts_listening_answer_3126660_1","order_index":1,"points":1},{"id":"en-practice-source-2-t4-l-q2","part_id":"en-practice-source-2-t4-l-p1","group_id":"en-practice-source-2-t4-l-g1-0","question_type":"source_text","ieltsQuestionType":"diagram_labelling","question_text":"","correct_answer":"garage","correct_answer_variants":["garage"],"answerCount":1,"sourceNumbers":[2],"sourceInputName":"ielts_listening_answer_3126660_2","order_index":2,"points":1},{"id":"en-practice-sou